description	"Czerka Security Force 

Mega-Corp Security with insider specialized weaponry, focused on holding objectives.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers on hit
-- 10% more Kb
-- 50% less Reach
-- 33% more Radius
- Employee Bonus Blaster (1)
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 25% less Dmg
-- 30% less FP Dmg

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Medpac  ^3[CS2]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee]"
